wh40k-company-chaos-name = Chaos
wh40k-company-chaos-description =
    Deserters, void raiders and cultists fly the eight-pointed star over the Red Sanctum, a remote dock in the Sanctum of Taaphetus system. They gather arms, patch up captured ships and provision raids into the Koronus Expanse.

    The warband keeps its base far from Imperial patrols. New recruits answer to its officers and can equip themselves through the quartermaster before venturing into the void.
wh40k-faction-chaos-summary = A warband of renegades based at the Red Sanctum.

job-name-wh40k-heretic = Heretic
job-description-wh40k-heretic = Serve the warband, resupply at the Red Sanctum and venture into the Koronus Expanse.
job-supervisors-wh40k-heretic = the warband's leader and officers
department-wh40k-chaos = Chaos
department-wh40k-chaos-description = The renegade warband based at the Red Sanctum.

koronus-system-taaphetus-name = Sanctum of Taaphetus
koronus-system-neos-charoitus-name = Neos Charoitus
koronus-system-battaida-name = Debris of Battaida
wh40k-chaos-outpost-name = Red Sanctum
wh40k-chaos-outpost-subtext = Chaos warband outpost
wh40k-chaos-outpost-description = A small renegade station at the far end of the Taaphetus route. Heretics muster here and use its quartermaster and shipyard.

wh40k-chaos-quartermaster-name = Quartermaster Vekra
wh40k-chaos-quartermaster-desc = A renegade outfitter keeping the Red Sanctum supplied with weapons, armour and provisions.
wh40k-chaos-merchant-title = Red Sanctum Supplies
wh40k-chaos-merchant-greeting = Weapons, armour and rations. Pick what you need before you leave the dock.
wh40k-chaos-dockmaster-name = Dockmaster Kord
wh40k-chaos-dockmaster-desc = The overseer of the Red Sanctum's only berth.
wh40k-chaos-dockmaster-intro = Welcome to the Red Sanctum. I'm Kord. Keep the airlock closed and the berth clear.
wh40k-chaos-dockmaster-directions = Vekra trades in the main hall. The shipyard terminal is by the airlock. Take Neos Charoitus and the Debris of Battaida to reach Speculum.
wh40k-chaos-shipyard-access-denied = Only members of the Chaos warband can use this shipyard.

vessel-chaosarvuswh40k-name = Defiled Arvus
vessel-chaosarvuswh40k-desc = A captured Arvus lighter refitted as the Red Sanctum's provisional transport.

